use firn/tags

wf-recorder is a Module
wf-recorder is tagged desktop

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.wf-recorder.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.wf-recorder]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."wf-recorder"."enable": enable "Wayland screen recorder"
